  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 201.01 Purpose of These Rules. The following rules are to assist interested parties in understanding and conforming to hearings procedures established to promote and assure the conduct of a full, fair, and adequate adjudication of issues and the expeditious resolution of disputes. This chapter is to be construed to secure the just, speedy, and inexpensive determination of every proceeding.\n\nSource. #2264, eff 1-6-83; ss by #2935, eff 12-27-84, EXPIRED 12-27-90\n\nNew. #5041, eff 1-9-91; ss by #5235, eff 9-27-91, EXPIRED: 9-27-97\n\nNew. #6631, INTERIM, eff 11-16-97, EXPIRED: 3-16-98\n\nNew. #6806, eff 7-18-98; ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07\n\nNew. #8922-A, eff 7-1-07; ss by #14534, eff 3-12-26",
